 tiny buttons and confusing interfaces. Our drum pads are designed for creative finger drumming, making it easy to lay down rhythms, basslines, and melodies on one screen.\n\nCAREER MODE CHALLENGE\nPut your skills to the test in an action-packed career mode. Progress through levels, unlock new sound packs, and rise from the bedroom studio to the main stage. This is the challenge game for aspiring music creators.\n\nVAST SOUND LIBRARY\nYour beats will sound polished from day one. Get access to hundreds of pro-quality sound packs and samples, with new kits for EDM, Trap, House, and Pop added every week.\n\nEASY SONG MAKER\nDon't just make loops—create full songs. Our simple studio view lets you arrange your patterns, add effects, and build a complete track from start to finish, all inside the app.\n\nJoin millions of players who learned to make music with our addictive beat making app. Rated 4.7/5 for making music creation fun and easy.\n\nStop dreaming about making music and start playing. Download now and create your first beat in the next 5 minutes.\n\nPrivacy Policy & Terms of Service: http://musicworldmedia.com/products/drum-pad/tos","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.61272,"languageCodesISO2A":["EN"],"fileSizeBytes":"226774016","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":6024,"trackContentRating":"4+","sellerUrl":"http://musicworldmedia.com/products/drum-pad/tos","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/beat-maker-pro-music-game/id1362013798?uo=4","contentAdvisoryRating":"4+","averageUserRating":4.61272,"trackCensoredName":"Beat Maker Pro: Music Game","genreIds":["6011","6016"],"artistId":452269707,"artistName":"MWM","bundleId":"com.mwm.sampler-app","releaseNotes":"Bug fixes and improvements.","genres":["Music","Entertainment"],"userRatingCount":6024}